+    student's top-K; teacher probabilities at those tokens are gathered from the
+    teacher's own top-K (tail-uniform approximation for misses), and both tail
+    masses are preserved, so the divergence is a proper JSD over the compressed
+    distributions (PTD-PO, arXiv:2606.07000).
